# Server + online (identity / progress / leaderboard / rooms)

## Server (`server/`)

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `docker-compose.yml` | Postgres + Nakama (`name: goofyballs`) |
| `.env` | Secrets (gitignored) |
| `nakama/local.yml` | Config + `runtime.env` |
| `nakama/modules/identity.lua` | Auth RPCs + Yandex custom hooks |
| `nakama/modules/progress.lua` | `progress_*` + Storage |
| `nakama/modules/leaderboard.lua` | `submit_match_result` / `leaderboard_top` |
| `nakama/modules/rooms.lua` | `room_create` / `join` / `close` |
| `nakama/modules/matchmaker.lua` | `mm_enqueue` / `status` / `cancel` |
| `nakama/modules/goofy_match.lua` | Stub authoritative match handler |
| `scripts/smoke_*.ps1` | Health / identity / progress / LB / rooms / MM |

### Contracts

- Progress: collection `player` / `progress`; merge `max()`; offline-first
- Leaderboard: `global_wins` authoritative; only `ranked` wins
- Rooms: Storage `room_codes`; 4-char code; TTL 45m; host close; `match_name` for relayed join
- Matchmaker: Storage lobby `ranked_1v1` + skill/region; returns `match_name`
- Realtime: nakama-godot + MultiplayerBridge `join_named_match` (relayed); `goofy_match` stub kept for later authoritative

### Must

- Pin image tags; secrets in `.env`; mount `./nakama` → `/nakama/data`
- YAML under `server/` — **spaces only** (tabs break parsers)
- Key player data by Nakama `user_id`
- After changing modules: `docker compose restart nakama`

### Ports

`5432` Postgres · `7349` gRPC · `7350` HTTP/WS · `7351` Console

## Client (`src/features/online/`)

- Single path: nakama-godot SDK only (no parallel HTTP client)
- `OnlineClient` — `NakamaClient` for auth + RPC; `OnlineSession` wraps `NakamaSession`
- `OnlineRealtime` — same `NakamaClient` → socket + `NakamaMultiplayerBridge`
- `OnlineService` + `PlatformAuth`; optional auto-login
- Autoload: `Nakama` → `addons/com.heroiclabs.nakama/Nakama.gd`
- Rooms/MM return `match_name`; service can auto `join_named_match`
- Must not block offline AI / local 2P; `core/` must not import Nakama

Plan: `.cursor/plans/online-server-backend.plan.md`
